    {"id":"new-argive-quest-board","kind":"quest-board","name":"Quest board","text":["The five color-wells of Dominaria are held by guardians. Earn each well's attunement.","When all five are yours, the Phyrexian Portal south of the city will open. So say the seers.","The mage towers' waystones carry those who beat their mages from tower to tower.","The arena opens soon. Practise your duelling."],"q":321,"r":309},
    {"id":"new-argive-folk-5","kind":"townsfolk","name":"Dock porter","text":["The Portal's road runs south out of the gate. Nobody comes back up it."],"q":328,"r":298},
